### Base Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### ====================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION & REGISTRATION
### ====================================================

### 2. Public Registration (Creates STAFF by default)
# @name registerStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Sarah Connor",
    "email": "sarah.staff@qflow.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login as Staff User (Save token from response)
# @name loginStaff
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "sarah.staff@qflow.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Store Staff Token (Paste token here or use REST client response variable)
@staffToken = {{loginStaff.response.body.token}}

### 4. Login as Default Seeded Admin User
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@qflow.com",
    "password": "admin123"
}

### Store Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### 5. Get Current User Profile (Staff Profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 6. Get Current User Profile (Admin Profile)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Admin Creates Another Staff User (Admin-only endpoint)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Counter Agent",
    "email": "john.agent@qflow.com",
    "password": "password123",
    "role": "STAFF"
}

### ====================================================
### 2. ROLE-BASED ACCESS CONTROL (RBAC) ON QUEUES
### ====================================================

### 8. Unauthorized: Create Queue without Token (Returns 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/queues
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "General Inquiries",
    "prefix": "GEN"
}

### 9. Forbidden: Staff Attempts to Create Queue (Returns 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "General Inquiries",
    "prefix": "GEN"
}

### 10. Success: Admin Creates Billing Counter Queue (Returns 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Billing Counter",
    "prefix": "BILL",
    "description": "Cash and card payment processing"
}

### 11. Success: Admin Creates Doctor Consultation Queue (Returns 201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/queues
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Doctor Consultation",
    "prefix": "DOC",
    "description": "General physician checkup"
}

### 12. Public: Get All Queues with Live Waiting Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/queues

### ====================================================
### 3. PUBLIC CUSTOMER FLOW (No Authentication Required)
### ====================================================

### 13. Customer 1 (Alice) Joins Billing Queue -> WAITING
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1,
    "customer_name": "Alice Johnson"
}

### 14. Customer 2 (Bob) Joins Billing Queue -> WAITING
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1,
    "customer_name": "Bob Smith"
}

### 15. Customer 3 (Charlie) Joins Billing Queue -> WAITING
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1,
    "customer_name": "Charlie Brown"
}

### 16. Customer Checks Ticket Details & People Ahead
GET {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1

### 17. Customer Cancels Ticket 3 while Waiting
# NOTE: Public ticket cancellation is a temporary limitation because tickets
# are not yet associated with authenticated customer accounts.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/3/cancel

### ====================================================
### 4. PROTECTED QUEUE OPERATOR WORKFLOW (Staff / Admin)
### ====================================================

### 18. Unauthorized: Operator Calls Next without Token (Returns 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1
}

### 19. Staff Calls Next Ticket for Billing Queue (Alice: WAITING -> CALLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/next
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1
}

### 20. Staff Starts Serving Ticket 1 (Alice: CALLED -> SERVING)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/start-serving
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 21. Staff Completes Ticket 1 (Alice: SERVING -> COMPLETED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 22. Staff Calls Next Ticket (Bob: WAITING -> CALLED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tickets/next
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "queue_id": 1
}

### 23. Staff Marks Ticket 2 as No-Show (Bob: CALLED -> NO_SHOW)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tickets/2/no-show
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}